...Because I... uh
...was kind wondering, um
...因为我...呃
...有点想知道，嗯

16:55.448 --> 16:57.793
Let's say I know this guy
假设我认识这个人

16:57.896 --> 17:01.241
who may have something
.to do with the oyster
谁可能有东西
.与牡蛎有关

17:01.344 --> 17:03.896
!?You know the guy who did it
！？你认识做这事的人

17:04.000 --> 17:04.862
[gulps ]
[咽口水]

17:04.965 --> 17:06.034
!Oh, this is great
！哦，这太棒了

17:06.137 --> 17:07.724
You and I can go
!turn him in
你和我可以走
！把他交出来

17:07.827 --> 17:10.862
,And then I'll get so much sleep
!I'll be gorgeous
，然后我就会睡很多觉
！我会很漂亮

17:10.965 --> 17:13.551
...Um, actually, I
.I'm just talking hypothetically
……嗯，其实我
.我只是假设性地说

17:13.655 --> 17:14.931
You don't
?know who did it
你不
？知道是谁干的

17:15.034 --> 17:17.793
!Well, um, I, uh, no
！嗯，嗯，我，呃，不

17:18.344 --> 17:20.206
?Squidward
?章鱼哥

17:20.310 --> 17:21.413
!Gotcha
！明白了

17:21.517 --> 17:22.448
!Aah
！啊啊

17:22.551 --> 17:24.448
Where were you
?on the day of today
你在哪里
？今天这一天

17:24.551 --> 17:26.379
Don't play games
!with me, mister
不要玩游戏
！跟我一起，先生

17:26.482 --> 17:27.827
,Hey, Patrick
?what are you doing
