?你在做什么

17:27.931 --> 17:29.206
!Oh hi, SpongeBob
！哦嗨，海绵宝宝

17:29.310 --> 17:31.344
I'm just continuing
my investigation
我只是继续
我的调查

17:31.448 --> 17:33.241
!of the great Clamu Caper
!伟大的克拉姆·卡佩尔

17:33.344 --> 17:35.793
Um... have you found out
?anything
嗯……你发现了吗
？任何东西

17:35.896 --> 17:36.931
!Yes
！是的

17:37.034 --> 17:40.241
.No, wait... um... no
.不，等等...嗯...不

17:40.344 --> 17:43.448
But this grain of sand
looks pretty suspicious
但这粒沙
看起来很可疑

17:43.551 --> 17:45.724
!and so does this rock
！这块岩石也是如此

17:45.827 --> 17:49.241
And I've got a few questions
!for this little piece of grass
我有几个问题
！为了这一小片草

17:49.344 --> 17:52.931
,Don't worry, SpongeBob
!Patrick's on the case
，别担心，海绵宝宝
！帕特里克正在处理此案

17:53.034 --> 17:55.827
The truth will be
!revealed
真相将是
！揭晓

17:55.931 --> 17:58.517
,I'd better go see Sandy
!she'll know what to do
,我最好去见桑迪
！她会知道该怎么做

17:58.620 --> 18:02.137
!Clamu wailing...]Ohh, I can't stand it anymore ]
！Clamu 哀号...]哦，我再也受不了了]

18:02.241 --> 18:03.689
,That poor
!poor critter
,那个可怜的
！可怜的小动物

18:03.793 --> 18:06.275
What kind of
inconsiderate person
什么样的
不体贴的人

18:06.379 --> 18:08.758
would upset
?such a gentle creature
会心烦意乱
？如此温柔的生物

18:08.862 --> 18:11.482
Uh, that's kind of what I
...wanted to talk to you about
呃，这就是我的情况
