18:11.586 --> 18:15.137
Why, when I find out who caused
that oyster so much pain
为什么，当我发现是谁造成的
那个牡蛎太痛苦了

18:15.241 --> 18:18.931
!No more jiggery pokery
！不再有摇摇欲坠的扑克游戏

18:19.034 --> 18:20.896
[grunting ]
[咕噜声]

18:21.000 --> 18:23.034
Now, what was it you wanted
?to talk about, SpongeBob
现在，你想要什么
？谈谈，海绵宝宝

