18:37.793 --> 18:41.172
...SpongeBob doesn't have hair
...海绵宝宝没有头发

18:41.275 --> 18:42.310
?or does he
？还是他

18:42.413 --> 18:48.758
[panting and whimpering ]
[喘息和呜咽]

18:48.862 --> 18:49.793
!Hey, SpongeBob
！嘿，海绵宝宝

18:51.793 --> 18:53.413
!This is it
！就是这样

18:53.517 --> 18:56.034
All of the clues
!are coming together
所有的线索
！在一起了

18:56.137 --> 19:00.137
I followed these footprints
right to this exact spot
我跟随这些脚印
就到这个地方

19:00.241 --> 19:02.379
and then, right
...where you're standing
然后，对
……你站的地方

19:02.482 --> 19:05.413
I found this bag
!of peanuts! Ha
我找到了这个包
