19:12.275 --> 19:13.827
...Mmm
...嗯

19:13.931 --> 19:16.689
Boy, crime-fighting
sure makes me hungry
男孩，打击犯罪
肯定让我饿了

19:16.793 --> 19:19.482
and this
yellow popsicle
!hits the spot
还有这个
黄色冰棒
！恰到好处

19:19.586 --> 19:21.448
Okay, uh, good luck
with all that, Patrick
好吧，祝你好运
尽管如此，帕特里克

19:21.551 --> 19:23.586
...and, uh
!I'll see you later
...还有，呃
！稍后见

19:23.689 --> 19:25.344
[chattering and whimpering ]
[喋喋不休和呜咽]

19:25.448 --> 19:27.310
:MAN
!Open up
!This is the police
:曼
！打开
！这是警察

19:27.413 --> 19:29.000
!Uh, uh, just a second
！呃，呃，请等一下

19:30.344 --> 19:32.172
?Are you SpongeBob SquarePants
?你是海绵宝宝吗

19:32.275 --> 19:33.482
?Y-y-yes
？是-是-是的

19:33.586 --> 19:35.517
Put those eyeballs
.back in your head, son
把那些眼球
.回到你的脑海里，儿子

19:35.620 --> 19:37.448
We've got a few
.questions for you
我们有几个
.向你提问

19:40.000 --> 19:40.827
Were you at the zoo
你在动物园吗

19:40.931 --> 19:42.344
on the day of the
?oyster incident
当天
？牡蛎事件

19:42.448 --> 19:45.137
!Um, um, um, yes
！嗯，嗯，嗯，是的

19:45.241 --> 19:46.689
Did you, or did you not
take part
你有没有
参加

19:46.793 --> 19:47.931
in various activities
?of zoo-time merriment
在各种活动中
?动物园里的欢乐时光

19:48.034 --> 19:50.241
...Yes
...是的

19:50.344 --> 19:52.827
...And are you familiar with
?this peanut
...你熟悉吗
?这个花生

19:52.931 --> 19:54.344
!Yes
！是的

19:54.448 --> 19:56.413
...Just one more question
...还有一个问题

19:56.517 --> 19:59.206
Is it true that you were
at the oyster's lair
你是真的吗
在牡蛎的巢穴

19:59.310 --> 20:02.310
?with a Mr. Patrick Star
？与帕特里克·明星先生

20:02.413 --> 20:05.862
:[crying ]
!Yes! Yes! It's true
：[哭]
！是的！是的！这是真的

20:05.965 --> 20:07.379
!It's all true
！这都是真的

20:07.482 --> 20:10.413
,The merriment
...the peanut
,欢乐
...花生

20:10.517 --> 20:12.034
!the Patrick
！帕特里克

20:12.137 --> 20:14.034
!That's all we need to know, son
！这就是我们需要知道的一切，儿子

20:14.137 --> 20:15.448
!Let's book him
！我们来预订他吧

20:17.000 --> 20:18.482
!Wow, you guys are good
！哇，你们真好

20:18.586 --> 20:21.620
I'm the last person
I would have suspected
我是最后一个人
我本来会怀疑

20:21.724 --> 20:24.172
but I was looking for me
!all the time
但我一直在寻找我
！一直

20:24.275 --> 20:26.413
!It's the perfect crime
！这是一次完美的犯罪

20:26.517 --> 20:29.586
Yeah, yeah, tell it
!to the judge, pinky
是啊是啊，快说吧
！给法官，小指

