[siren wailing ]
[警笛哀嚎]

20:33.551 --> 20:36.000
!Wait, stop
！等等，停下来

20:36.103 --> 20:38.137
!I'm the one you want
！我就是你想要的人

20:38.241 --> 20:40.379
!I am the criminal
