21:01.724 --> 21:03.655
[crowd booing ]
[人群起哄]

21:03.758 --> 21:04.448
!Wait
！等待

21:04.551 --> 21:05.655
!Hold your peanuts
！抱住你的花生

21:05.758 --> 21:07.931
!Patrick Star is innocent
！帕特里克·斯塔是无辜的

21:08.034 --> 21:11.379
I have come here
!to reveal the truth
我来过这里
!揭露真相

21:11.482 --> 21:13.000
They say
that truth and honesty
他们说
真理和诚实

21:13.103 --> 21:15.517
will be rewarded
!with trust and forgiveness
将得到奖励
！带着信任和宽恕

21:15.620 --> 21:17.413
humming ]
[...dramatic theme
嗡嗡声]
[...戏剧性的主题

21:17.517 --> 21:19.689
I'm here to lay my cards
on the table
我是来打牌的
在桌子上

21:19.793 --> 21:23.000
to trim the branches
of deception from
the tree of life
修剪树枝
的欺骗来自
生命之树

21:23.103 --> 21:27.206
to shave away the unkempt
sideburns from the face
...of truth! I
刮掉蓬头垢面的
脸上的鬓角
...真理！我

21:27.310 --> 21:29.896
Hey! Just get on
!with it
嘿！上车吧
！用它

21:30.000 --> 21:32.655
I am the one
.who threw the peanut
我就是那个
.谁扔了花生

21:32.758 --> 21:35.655
I know now that what
...I have done is wrong
我现在知道那是什么
...我所做的是错误的

21:35.758 --> 21:39.517
,and so I say, I am sorry
!giant performing oyster
