21:39.620 --> 21:41.586
.I am sorry, Patrick
.对不起，帕特里克

21:41.689 --> 21:44.448
,I am sorry
citizens of Bikini Bottom
,对不起
比基尼堡公民

21:44.551 --> 21:46.000
[Patrick stops humming ]
[帕特里克停止哼唱]

21:46.103 --> 21:50.103
Hey! Let's
throw peanuts
!at both of 'em
嘿！让我们
扔花生
！在他们两个

21:50.206 --> 21:51.758
[crowd yelling ]
[人群喊叫]

21:51.862 --> 21:55.137
.Wait! Here's the real criminal
